From deb9808ab5e6048e0cf953c34258cda02ede27cf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: moWerk <mo@mowerk.net>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 14:24:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 03/16] pro1x-audio

From fxtec-pro1x-nixos device/kernel/patches/pro1x-audio.patch (nyymi609, written
against v7.1), rebased onto v7.3 for the SailfishOS port. The board DTS hunks were
3-way merged with upstream 7.1..7.3 changes to sm6115-fxtec-pro1x.dts.

LLMGD-0 A0
